# For the differential test against a real sshd: list arithmetic, aliases, first-wins, time units.
Ciphers -*-cbc,aes192-ctr
MACs ^hmac-sha2-512
KexAlgorithms +diffie-hellman-group14-sha1
HostKeyAlgorithms -ssh-rsa*,*nistp521*
PubkeyAcceptedAlgorithms rsa-sha2-512,ssh-ed25519
PermitRootLogin without-password
X11Forwarding yes
X11Forwarding no
MaxAuthTries 4
LoginGraceTime 1m30s
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication=no
UsePAM yes
LogLevel verbose
AllowTcpForwarding local
GatewayPorts clientspecified
